   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent Member of the Joint Evaluation Group and Independent Peer Reviewers for the TradeMark East Africa Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Independent Member of the Joint Evaluation Group and Independent Peer Reviewers for the TradeMark East Africa Evaluation is a component of Regional East Africa Integration Programme Phase II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;38,542. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Industrial development, Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Trade policy and administrative management, Transport policy and administrative management, Social Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
